  m_Name: WindowsDoubleTap
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  notes: 'GUESS (plan.md Q11): Windows is assumed to recognise a double tap when the second finger lifts (a tap with count 2; taps complete on release), like iOS. Check on a Surface; if it is on the second finger down, change WindowsDoubleTap.EntersOnSecondDown to true.'
